;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  rowspan=3D2  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >P1</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >短信效果反馈</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >xx</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1、短信发送量；2、回流用户数量</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-top:none;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1、分短信、回流天数查看 2、uid可导出</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr></table><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.2 需求拆解</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >产品迭代或者运营策略时，要有核心的</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >kpi指标，也就是产品功能上线后用于衡量效果的指标。指标包括大盘指标，可以反应业务整体情况、用户规模等，例如PV、DAU、MAU等，这些指标对于大体量的APP，一般是不会有太大的波动的。还有就是业务指标，不同业务关注的各不相同，例如营销业务下，重点关注的是营销活动的参与、核销以及相关的金额等指标；搜索业务下，会关注搜索词、底纹词等指标； </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >依据业务模型，我们可以很清晰的找到业务流程中各个关键节点，继而定义出衡量指标。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3.埋点方案拆解</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >有了指标诉求，接下来就简单了。将指标的统计口径，拆解到具体的功能场景中，确定不同场景中的数据诉求，继而设计出科学合理的埋点需求。</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >一个比较合理的埋点方案应该如何拆解呢？</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >上述需求有一个场景，在抽奖机模块中，用户每天可以抽三次奖，用户需要通过做任务赢取更多的抽奖次数。对于抽奖机来说，最重要的是让更多用户参与到抽奖中，继而通过领券产生权益的发放核销。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >这是一个很常见的活动场景，运营最需要关注的就是如何让用户参与到抽奖中，并且能够更多次的抽奖。</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >假设业务流程是这样的：用户进入抽奖机</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >-&gt;用户点击抽奖-&gt;做任务-&gt;抽奖-&gt;做任务→抽奖。利用业务路径自然创建的业务漏斗，需要运营的就是漏斗中每个节点流失的人群。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"400"  height=3D"265"  src=3D"~tmp{37b150da-6cc1-43be-97b1-ce8b1fc49c4e}3280106.files/~tmp{37b150da-6cc1-43be-97b1-ce8b1fc49c4e}32801064311.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >所以我们需要关心的是指标如下：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >1.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >进入抽奖机的人数</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >2.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >参与抽奖的人数</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >3.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >参与抽奖一次、二次、三次的人数</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >通过以上拆解出的指标，下一步就是确定指标的口径。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >1.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >进入抽奖机的人数</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D 抽奖机模块的曝光UV</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >2.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >参与抽奖的人数</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D 点击抽奖按钮的UV</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >3.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >参与抽奖一次、二次、三次的人数</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D 包含抽奖次数的点击抽奖按钮的UV</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >注意，这里包含抽奖次数的点击是非常重要的，因为通常，我们需要看的数据都是类似有具体业务含义的指标，这样才能更精确的分析用户行为，做更精细化的运营。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

